    },
    {
      "relation": "ADDRESSES",
      "target": "failure mode identification",
      "target_type": "task",
      "evidence": "Current prognostic approaches either ignore failure modes during degradation or assume known failure mode labels, which can be challenging to acquire in practice. Moreover, the high dimensionality and complex relations of sensor signals make it challenging to identify the failure modes accurately."
    },
